sstable: N writes, N bytes, avg N.N us, max N us
wal: N writes, N bytes, avg N.N us, max N us
vlog: N writes, N bytes, avg N.N us, max N us

=+=+= Write Stalls By Reason =+=+=
wal_append: N stalls, N us total, N us max
rotate_lock: N stalls, N us total, N us max
rotate_work: N stalls, N us total, N us max
admission: N stalls, N us total, N us max
manifest_commit: N stalls, N us total, N us max

=+=+= Key Log Encoding =+=+=
Chains: N, logical N bytes, stored N bytes, N.Nx

=+=+= Value Log Encoding =+=+=
Chains: N, logical N bytes, stored N bytes, N.Nx

=+=+= Tombstones =+=+=
